        <mxCell id="legend-box" value="&lt;b&gt;Role colors&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Admin (red)  ·  Supply (orange)  ·  Inventory (yellow)&lt;br/&gt;Property (green)  ·  Auditor (blue)  ·  Employee (purple)&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Arrow conventions&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;━━━  Solid  →  control / call flow&lt;br/&gt;╌╌╌  Dashed  →  external boundary (SMTP, file system)&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Shape conventions&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Rounded rectangle  →  application module&lt;br/&gt;Square rectangle  →  framework / model file&lt;br/&gt;Cylinder  →  database&lt;br/&gt;Gray fill  →  vendor / third-party" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#000000;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
